Begin Verify that an empty Transcription Statistics form works
	Navigate "?f=layout&module=SystemReport&name=TranscriptionStats"
	Click the "Run Query" button
	Verify exists "butler" text
	Verify exists "physician3" text
	Verify exists "selenium" text
	Verify exists "7405" text
	Verify exists "944" text
	Verify exists "00:00:21" text
	Verify exists "8718" text
	Verify exists "21" text
	Verify exists "3" text
	Verify exists "7" text
	Verify exists "43" text

Begin Verify that a department filtered Transcription Statistics form works
	Enter "Physicians" in the "Select Department:" autocomplete
	Click the "Run Query" button
	Verify exists "physician3" text
	Verify exists "selenium" text
	Verify exists "butler" text

Begin Verify that a user filtered Transcription Statistics form works
	Navigate "?f=layout&module=SystemReport&name=TranscriptionStats"
	Enter "Butler" in the "Select User:" autocomplete
	Click the "Run Query" button
	Verify !exists "physician3" text
	Verify exists "butler" text
	Verify exists "7405" text
	Verify exists "00:00:21" text
	Verify exists "944" text
	Verify exists "8" text
	Verify exists "6" text
	Verify exists "15" text
	Verify exists "113" text
	Verify exists "134" text
	Verify exists "1290" text

Begin Verify that a provider filtered Transcription Statistics form works
	Navigate "?f=layout&module=SystemReport&name=TranscriptionStats"
	Enter "Nicole" in the "Limit to Provider:" autocomplete
	Click the "Run Query" button
	Verify exists "physician3" text
	Verify exists "40" text
	Verify exists "48" text
	Verify exists "10" text
	Verify exists "00:00:00" text
	Verify !exists "butler" text

Begin Verify that a document filtered Transcription Statistics form works
	Navigate "?f=layout&module=SystemReport&name=TranscriptionStats"
	Select "Alert Comment" from the "Document Type:" field
	Click the "Run Query" button
	Verify exists "physician3" text
	Verify exists "butler" text
	Verify exists "401" text
	Verify exists "474" text
	Verify exists "00:00:03" text
	Verify exists "29" text
	Verify exists "6" text
	Verify exists "36" text
	Verify exists "150" text

