Begin Verify that a encounter obs filtered Transcription Statistics form works
	Navigate "?f=layout&module=SystemReport&name=TranscriptionStats"
	Select "Encounter Observations" from the "Transcription Type:" field
	Click the "Run Query" button
	Verify !exists "physician3" text
