Begin Verify that a encounter text filtered Transcription Statistics form works
	Navigate "?f=layout&module=SystemReport&name=TranscriptionStats"
	Select "Encounter Text" from the "Transcription Type:" field
	Click the "Run Query" button
	Verify exists "physician3" text
	Verify !exists "butler" text
	Verify exists "40" text
	Verify exists "48" text
	Verify exists "10" text
	Verify exists "1" text

Begin Verify that a date range filtered Transcription Statistics form works
	Navigate "?f=layout&module=SystemReport&name=TranscriptionStats"
	Type "03" in the @Transcribed Date Range #2:@xpath='//*[@id="sdt2MONTH"]'
	Type "11" in the @Transcribed Date Range #2:@xpath='//*[@id="sdt2DAY"]'
	Type "2024" in the @Transcribed Date Range #2:@xpath='//*[@id="sdt2YEAR"]'
	Click the "Run Query" button
	Verify exists "physician3" text
	Verify exists "butler" text
	Verify exists "selenium" text
	Verify exists "-7393" text
	Verify exists "-1288" text
	Verify exists "-114" text
	Verify exists "-134" text
	Verify exists "-14" text
	Verify exists "-1" text
	Verify exists "-5" text
	Verify exists "-24" text
	Verify exists "-29" text